windows端接收图像：
gst-launch-1.0 udpsrc port=5000 caps="application/x-rtp, media=(string)video, clock-rate=(int)90000, encoding-name=(string)H265, payload=(int)96" ! rtph265depay ! h265parse ! avdec_h265 ! videoconvert ! videoscale ! video/x-raw ! d3d11videosink sync=false

windows端接收并保存图像：
gst-launch-1.0 udpsrc port=5000 caps="application/x-rtp, media=(string)video, clock-rate=(int)90000, encoding-name=(string)H265, payload=(int)96" ! rtph265depay ! h265parse ! avdec_h265 ! videoconvert ! videoscale ! video/x-raw ! pngenc ! multifilesink location="frame_%05d.png"


